STAR

This source snapshot contains project modifications to training code derived
from Vision-OPD (https://github.com/VisionOPD/Vision-OPD) and verl
(https://github.com/volcengine/verl). Their copyright and license headers are
retained. The bundled verl fork identifies itself as version 0.7.0.dev0.

The benchmark preparation and scoring implementation under
evaluation/vision_opd_official derives from the Vision-OPD evaluation pipeline.
Project changes include deterministic decoding, answer reuse, complete-result
checks, and handling of unresolved samples.

The standalone distribution removes internal scheduler and model-storage
integration. It adds local training recipes and the STAR-6K release importer.
The STAR loss, Teacher attention centers, support union, and world sampler
retain their experiment implementation.

